## Strings added by the Bedrock port, merged into every language by tools/import-jar.mjs.
## Add <locale>.lang next to this file to translate them; locales without one use English.
minepreggo.gender.body=Choose your character's gender. Only female characters can become pregnant.
minepreggo.gender.later=Minepreggo needs your character's gender. The choice comes back in 10 seconds, or run /scriptevent minepreggo:gender female (or male).
minepreggo.pregnancy.controls=You're pregnant! Crouch to check on your pregnancy, crouch and look down to rub your belly, and use a glass bottle when lactating.
minepreggo.pregnancy.belly=P0: the belly is still flat, as in the mod. It starts to show at P2 (P3 for the monster creeper girl) and is unmistakable from P3, a few Minecraft days in. Operators can jump ahead: /scriptevent minepreggo:pregnancy phase 5
